Scope

The MIT licence above covers the original SHADOW SIX source code (src/, styles/,
tools/, tests/, index.html). It does not cover third-party material:

- vendor/ holds three.js and its addon libraries under their own licences
  (see vendor/LICENSE and CREDITS.md).
- assets/ holds art, audio, fonts and generated media under their own licences
  (mostly CC0 / public domain, fonts under OFL or Apache-2.0); each is listed
  in CREDITS.md and the per-directory credit files it points to.

Fan-tribute notice

SHADOW SIX is an unofficial, non-commercial fan tribute to Commandos: Behind
Enemy Lines (Pyro Studios / Eidos Interactive, 1998). It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by or connected to Pyro Studios, Eidos, Square Enix or Kalypso
Media. 'Commandos' is a trademark of its owner. No assets from the original
game are used; all art, audio and code are original or CC0/redistributable
(see CREDITS.md).
